## https://wezterm.org/config/default-keys.html
WezTerm: Select (When general selection is invalid) | S-L_drag
WezTerm: Switch color scheme (User)                 | <leader>C
WezTerm: Toggle full screen (User)                  | <leader>F
WezTerm: Search (User)                              | C-S-p
WezTerm: Copy to clipboard (User)                   | C-Ins
WezTerm: Paste from clipboard (User)                | C-v / S-Ins
WezTerm: Trigger VIM with scrollback (User)         | C-S-e
WezTerm: Split pane right or zoom (User)            | C-S-A-l
WezTerm: Complete selection (User)                  | L_clink
WezTerm: Copy selection and clear (User)            | R_clink
WezTerm: Open link at mouse cursor (User)           | C-L_clink
WezTerm: Spawn new tab (User)                       | C-S-t
WezTerm: Spawn new window (User)                    | C-S-n
WezTerm: Split vertical (User)                      | <leader>-/s
WezTerm: Split horizontal (User)                    | <leader>\/v
WezTerm: Activate pane direction (User)             | <leader>h/j/k/l
WezTerm: Adjust pane size (User)                    | <leader>H/J/K/L
WezTerm: Toggle pane zoom state (User)              | <leader>z
WezTerm: Close current pane (User)                  | <leader>x
WezTerm: Activate tab $ (User)                      | <leader>$
WezTerm: Close current tab (User)                   | <leader>&
WezTerm: (Windows) Move tab left (User)             | C-A-h
WezTerm: (Windows) Move tab right (User)            | C-A-l
WezTerm: Send string "Ctrl-a" (User)                | <leader>C-a